    {
      "bbox": [
        510,
        591,
        1300,
        629
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, it is necessary and desirable to amend Executive Order No. 55, dated March 29, 1976, entitled \"Delegation of Powers of the Finance Board\".",
